⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
353 calories 41g protein (for the entire pint, including mix-ins)

Churray for Churros Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 130 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk (can sub with a vanilla protein shake and 20g less sweetener)
- 40-45g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 0.5g (⅛ tsp) butter extract
- 2-3g (½ tsp) cinnamon
- 5g (1 tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- 1 @Prime Bites Protein Treats Glazed Cinnamon Roll Protein Brownie (chopped and coated in a sprinkle of cinnamon and sweetener)
353 cal 29g C, 9g F, 41g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Top with the Brownie pieces and mix in by hand

